ClickDealer is one of the top-5 CPA networks worldwide. Since 2012, the company has been in performance marketing, partnering with over 2,000 advertisers across more than 40 verticals. HQ in the Netherlands, with over 5 offices across the globe.

We are looking for an experienced Media Buying Specialist to drive profitable ad campaigns across our core verticals and markets, and to grow our media buying operations globally.

 

Company markets: North America, Europe, Asia (Worldwide)
Verticals: Lead Generation (Insurance, Solar, Legal, etc.), Nutra (Diet, ME, Telehealth, Skincare, etc), E-commerce (Drop shipping), SOI Sweepstakes 
Traffic sources: Social networks (Facebook, Instagram, Snapchat, TikTok), Native

What we expect from you:
- Excellent knowledge of main traffic sources such as Facebook, Instagram, Taboola, Outbrain, TikTok;
- Deep understanding of the traffic source ecosystem for the vertical, ability to create and manage ad campaigns.

What you’ll be doing:
- Driving traffic with ROI of +25% on minimum monthly volumes starting from $10k gross profit;
- Using trackers and other analytics tools to monitor traffic;
- Independently building workflows to generate profit starting from 10000 $ per month with potential for growth.

We offer:

- Real growth opportunities in an international market;

- 20 paid vacation days + paid sick leave;

- 50% coverage for sports, therapy, courses, and language classes;

- Cross-team knowledge sharing - no unnecessary bureaucracy.

